             Moving to Somerville? 
 Moving is always a stressful time, and finding what you need to know in a new city can be overwhelming. to help, Somerville has created a New Resident's Guide. This guide is a one-stop shop for everything a first-time resident of Somerville needs to know - and is even useful for long-time residents looking for basic information about utilities, trash and recycling, parking, and more.  
